TEXT 1312 320 Left 2 !*\n.param L=50u ; inductance value\n.param Vin=10 ; input voltage\n.param Vout=15 ; output voltage\n.param Fsw=300k ; switching frequency\n.param Ri=0.3 ; sense resistance (neg. for a boost)\n.param Sn={Vin*Ri/L} ; on-time inductor current slope\n.param Mc=1.0 ; amount of slope compensation (see RRidley thesis)\n.param Se={(mc-1)*Sn} ; external ramp level for meeting Mc\n*
TEXT 776 1376 Left 2 ;This is a crude way to close the loop in dc\n(and have LTspice compute the right control voltage)\nwhile opening it in ac via LoL/CoL. The subcircuit\ntoggles into DCM for RL at/above 300 ohms.
